{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 1, "text": "在这里待着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 2, "text": "我好像掉了什么东西。我马上回来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 3, "text": "然后我们就可以前往另一个世界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 5, "text": "好的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 8, "text": "让我们来玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 9, "text": "我想要我的小熊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 10, "text": "他走丢了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 11, "text": "快帮我找到他！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 14, "text": "你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 15, "text": "你在看什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 25, "text": "// Quest 1 (Who are you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 26, "text": "我是米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 27, "text": "最好的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 28, "text": "最初的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 29, "text": "米塔就是这么说的，我的米塔大人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why do you look like that?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 32, "text": "我看起来怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 33, "text": "我看起来怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 34, "text": "我看起来怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 35, "text": "米塔大人夸我非常漂亮，沉鱼落雁，独一无二。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 36, "text": "这就是我的样子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 38, "text": "// Quest 3 (What was Mita doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 39, "text": "她会带我走的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 40, "text": "我们会生活在一个崭新的世界里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 41, "text": "米塔大人邀请了我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 42, "text": "她会带我走的，我们会一起玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 44, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do you need a teddy bear?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 45, "text": "你是一只小熊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 46, "text": "你迷路了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 47, "text": "就像我的小熊一样。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Quest 5 (Why is Mita angry?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 50, "text": "我的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 51, "text": "米塔大人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 52, "text": "她想玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 53, "text": "她想带走的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 54, "text": "只有我一个人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 55, "text": "我们是独特的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 56, "text": "我们是唯一的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 57, "text": "米塔和米塔大人"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 58, "text": "0.8A和8М54*"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Quest 6 (Do you believe Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 61, "text": "米塔大人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 62, "text": "我最好的朋友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 63, "text": "米塔大人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 64, "text": "我唯一的朋友。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 67, "text": "是你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 68, "text": "看。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 69, "text": "让我们来玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location12", "line_index": 70, "text": "我来教你怎么玩。"}
